--- text
Your email address is changing

A request was made at [EVENT_TIME] to change the email address on
your [PRODUCT_NAME] account from [OLD_EMAIL_ADDRESS] to
[NEW_EMAIL_ADDRESS].

Once the change takes effect, [OLD_EMAIL_ADDRESS] will stop
receiving mail from [PRODUCT_NAME], and you will sign in with
[NEW_EMAIL_ADDRESS] instead. This is the last message we will send
to this address.

Important: If you did not ask for this change, someone else may
have access to your account. Cancel the change now and change
your password.

Cancel this change:

[SECONDARY_URL]

You can cancel the change until [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] -
[EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after this email was sent. After that the change
takes effect and it cannot be stopped from this address.

We will never ask you for your password by email. If anything here
looks wrong, reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A
real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
